{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 68,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let God arise, let his enemies be scattered;\nLet them also that hate him flee before him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As smoke is driven away, so drive them away:\nAs wax melteth before the fire,\nSo let the wicked perish at the presence of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But let the righteous be glad; let them exult before God:\nYea, let them rejoice with gladness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Sing unto God, sing praises to his name:\nCast up a highway for him that rideth through the deserts;\nHis name is Jehovah; and exult ye before him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A father of the fatherless, and a judge of the widows,\nIs God in his holy habitation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God setteth the solitary in families:\nHe bringeth out the prisoners into prosperity;\nBut the rebellious dwell in a parched land.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O God, when thou wentest forth before thy people,\nWhen thou didst march through the wilderness; [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The earth trembled,\nThe heavens also dropped ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "rain",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " at the presence of God:\nYon Sinai ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "trembled",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " at the presence of God, the God of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou, O God, didst send a plentiful rain,\nThou didst confirm thine inheritance, when it was weary.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thy congregation dwelt therein:\nThou, O God, didst prepare of thy goodness for the poor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The Lord giveth the word:\nThe women that publish the tidings are a great host.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Kings of armies flee, they flee;\nAnd she that tarrieth at home divideth the spoil.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When ye lie among the sheepfolds,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "It is as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the wings of a dove covered with silver,\nAnd her pinions with yellow gold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When the Almighty scattered kings therein,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "It was as when",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " it snoweth in Zalmon.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A mountain of God is the mountain of Bashan;\nA high mountain is the mountain of Bashan.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Why look ye askance, ye high mountains,\nAt the mountain which God hath desired for his abode?\nYea, Jehovah will dwell ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The chariots of God are twenty thousand, even thousands upon thousands:\nThe Lord is among them, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Sinai, in the sanctuary.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou hast ascended on high, thou hast led away captives;\nThou hast received gifts among men,\nYea, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "among",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the rebellious also, that Jehovah God might dwell ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "with them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed be the Lord, who daily beareth our burden,\nEven the God who is our salvation. [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God is unto us a God of deliverances;\nAnd unto Jehovah the Lord belongeth escape from death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But God will smite through the head of his enemies,\nThe hairy scalp of such a one as goeth on still in his guiltiness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The Lord said, I will bring again from Bashan,\nI will bring ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " again from the depths of the sea;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That thou mayest crush ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "dipping",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy foot in blood,\nThat the tongue of thy dogs may have its portion from ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thine",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " enemies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They have seen thy goings, O God,\nEven the goings of my God, my King, into the sanctuary.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The singers went before, the minstrels followed after,\nIn the midst of the damsels playing with timbrels.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Bless ye God in the congregations,\nEven the Lord, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "ye that are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the fountain of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is little Benjamin their ruler,\nThe princes of Judah ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " their council,\nThe princes of Zebulun, the princes of Naphtali.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thy God hath commanded thy strength:Strengthen, O God, that which thou hast wrought for us.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Because of thy temple at Jerusalem\nKings shall bring presents unto thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Rebuke the wild beast of the reeds,\nThe multitude of the bulls, with the calves of the peoples,Trampling under foot the pieces of silver:He hath scattered the peoples that delight in war.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Princes shall come out of Egypt;Ethiopia shall haste to stretch out her hands unto God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Sing unto God, ye kingdoms of the earth;\nOh sing praises unto the Lord; [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To him that rideth upon the heaven of heavens, which are of old;\nLo, he uttereth his voice, a mighty voice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ascribe ye strength unto God:\nHis excellency is over Israel,\nAnd his strength is in the skies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.68.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O God, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thou art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " terrible out of thy holy places:\nThe God of Israel, he giveth strength and power unto ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " people.\nBlessed be God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Jehovah the God of Sinai and of the sanctuary.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "For the Chief Musician; A Psalm of David, a Song.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
